    "detailed_description": "This is an open ended collection type RPG game<br><br>Our heroine ruby is an orphan,<br>Every morning, she goes out to explore the secret island of God<br>Every night, she put on her nightdress<br><br>Go to all places, steal treasures or precious paintings<br>Let yourself have a warm home<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283110/extras/cbd030b8059e6a48ce5f4c8fa864b1eb.avif?t=1677329093\" /></div><br>The story begins in Sincere City<br>In this small town, there are many precious treasures and stories left by her parents<br><br>Game manipulation<br><br>Left or right mouse button<br>Keyboard space ESC and direction key<br>Some game controllers are supported<br><br><br>Game features<br><br>There are many cute pets waiting for you to collect in the game<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283110/extras/1c6b3ba654d8c4684cc5948c793bf2c0.avif?t=1677329093\" /></div><br>Every day, if you want to go to sea,<br>The islands you go to are all random, which is worth your repeated exploration and adventure<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283110/extras/8663e7c413fc278b2cd2da2f1b3f1a19.avif?t=1677329093\" /></div><br>16 hidden CGS<br>Among them, 15 CG are nude body art paintings, please don't buy the game if you don't like it^_^<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283110/extras/134e45c92958faaa9db7e50981493570.avif?t=1677329093\" /></div><br>Characters and events in the game are accompanied by day and night system<br>Every day will change!<br><br>for example<br>Mysterious merchant, hidden treasure<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283110/extras/c7d6fd42759779c901f174b7f8ef8378.avif?t=1677329093\" /></div><br>Go to the auction house for auction<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283110/extras/98c005820711e88aeb25c61a49e12e1d.avif?t=1677329093\" /></div><br>Museum donation<br>Learn some useful or useless magic<br>You need to switch your clothes between day and night, and make a lot of money in the game<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283110/extras/de9f1b1296f26b369efaf071888beab9.avif?t=1677329093\" /></div><br>Decorate your home with your own efforts<br><br><br>In games<br>You need to avoid the police, thieves and monsters<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283110/extras/6d7f085b2a8e0b7f5ea981c9ce45a403.avif?t=1677329093\" /></div><br>Protect yourself from being hurt by them!<br>There are a variety of magic props and rich hidden elements in the game, waiting for everyone's discovery!",
